            <div xml:id="d129">

                <pb facs="0268" n="238" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54Guat/pg238"/>

                <head>129. Telegram From Operation PBSUCCESS Headquarters in Florida to the CIA
                    Station in Guatemala<anchor n="1" xml:id="d129-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>[<hi rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>], <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1954-04-18T02:38:00+00:00">April 18, 1954,
                        0238Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>1959. 1. HQs states ODACID reluctant involve any their people operational aspects
                    PBSUCCESS; therefore, you will instruct Page that until notified otherwise, he
                    should not request assistance of JMBLUG. Whiting letter re Page trip to WSBURNT
                    being held HQs pending complete clarification foregoing with ODACID.</p>
                <pb facs="0269" n="239" xml:id="pg239"/>
                <p>2. Page should be advised that present ODACID position re participation ODYOKE
                    persons in PBSUCCESS makes it even more necessary that he: <list>
                        <label>A.</label>
                        <item>Contact Soccer only under maximum security conditions.</item>
                        <label>B.</label>
                        <item>Absolutely avoid Soccer participation in operations.</item>
                    </list></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
